      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a huge pain to diagnose once you notice it happening and has broken several of my worlds.  For example: \nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_cd6a9712-1192-4b4c-b694-29590a920a13\n\nThe point is to be able to spawn in ramps/platforms/etc and build things with them, but if someone joins afterward, they will see exactly one prefab spawned.  Makes the whole world pretty much unplayable unless you never leave and don't invite anyone else. :/",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
